    {
      "id": "capture",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1. Capture\n\n`00. Fleeting Notes`\n\nSeconds. No structure, no judgement.\nCtrl+N lands here by default.\n\n**Expires in a week.**",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "read",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2. Read\n\n`01. Source Material`\n\nOne note per source.\nClaims, quotes, and *my reading* kept apart.\n\nCopy-paste stops here.",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "think",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3. Think\n\n`04. Zettelkasten`\n\nOne idea. Own words. Full sentences.\nID = `YYYYMMDDHHmm`, flat forever.\n\n**Two links minimum, at creation.**",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "find",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4. Find\n\n`02. Indexes`\n\nBuild a MOC when a cluster grows\ntoo big to hold in your head.\n\nNot before.",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "log",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Daily\n\n`05. Thought Logs`\n\nWhat got captured, what got processed.\nMakes the backlog visible.",
      "x": 210,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "tpl",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Scaffolds\n\n`03. Templates`\n\nFleeting \u00b7 Literature \u00b7 Permanent \u00b7 Daily Log\n\nApplied automatically by\n*Create new unique note*.",
      "x": 630,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "rules",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## The rules that matter\n\n**Two links, with reasons.**\nA bare `[[link]]` wastes the link.\nThe reason is the knowledge.\n\n**Flat slip-box.**\nNo subfolders in `04`. Ever.\nStructure lives in links, not directories.\n\n**Write for five-years-from-now**, not for today\nwith the source still open.",
      "x": 1680,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
